t run of Stage 1 projector pre-training + Stage 2 LoRA on a 10% DocVQA training sample, evaluated on DocVQA v1 val and 20 held-out spatial questions from DocVQA2026 val, would provide the empirical anchor the paper currently lacks entirely. Without this, the submission reads as an architecture proposal rather than a methods paper, which is a poor fit for EMNLP.",
